Spec: Interactive local declaration review console

Purpose:
  Let an owner inspect and decide local declaration candidates through an explicit development terminal.

Owns:
  ./LinkGate.Review.Console.csproj
  ./Program.cs
  ./README.md

Structure:
  ./ReviewWorkflow.cs: Bounded human review and recovery commands.
  ./ReviewIntentFile.cs: Private durable receipt and exclusive console lease.
  ./ReviewText.cs: Safe rendering of untrusted declaration content.
  ./ReviewTerminal.cs: Bounded terminal input adapter.

References:
  ../LinkGate.Broker/RegistrationReview.sdd
  /docs/adr/0011-local-review-console.md

Must:
  Require an existing explicit state database, interactive input/output and typed opening confirmation before initialization.
  Reject redirected automation without opening state; provide no automatic approval flags or management listener.
  Keep the lack of binary identity verification and network grant authority visible to the operator.

Tasks:
  [x] #1 Deliver the console with verified review, durable recovery and redirected-input rejection.
